"Uniformization of complete Kähler manifolds with positive bisectional
curvature" (OpenAI Math Release preprint, September 23, 2026). The paper
itself is not included. This repository is an independent formalization and
is not affiliated with or endorsed by the paper's authors.

Dependencies that are NOT included (fetched by Lake at build time)
------------------------------------------------------------------
Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4, toolchain v4.35.0) and Mathlib
(https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4, tag v4.35.0, revision
56a005855ea17e0b0958f73ec801ae140b0a1679), both Apache-2.0, together with
Mathlib's own dependencies, each under the license of its own repository.
Their exact revisions are recorded in lake-manifest.json.
